OL,3,GNEWSAStreet fireworks arrests amid
OL,4,ABonfire Night disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FFireworks were set off in a residential
OL,7,Fstreet as 17 people were arrested on
OL,8,FBonfire Night across Greater
OL,9,FManchester.
OL,11,FA video, filmed on Thursday night,
OL,12,Fshows fireworks being launched in the
OL,13,Fstreet in all directions, which police
OL,14,Fsaid was one of several incidents
OL,15,Flinked to anti-social behaviour across
OL,16,Fthe region.
