OL,3,GNEWSAStreet fireworks arrests amid
OL,4,ABonfire Night disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 600 fireworks were seized and
OL,7,FGreater Manchester Police officers
OL,8,Fcarried out more than 160
OL,9,Fstop-and-searches during targeted
OL,10,Fpatrols in areas identified as
OL,11,Fhotspots.
OL,13,FEight of the arrests were made in
OL,14,FTameside after reports of youths
OL,15,Fmisusing fireworks in Millennium Green
OL,16,FPark in Ashton-under-Lyne.
